  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nYou can target 1 \"Archfiend\" Spell/Trap in
    your GY or banishment; destroy this card, and if you do, add that target to your
    hand. You can only use this effect of \"Archfiend Matriarch\" once per turn.\n\n[
    Monster Effect ] \nYou can Ritual Summon this card with \"Throne of the Archfiends\".
    Must be Ritual Summoned. Unaffected by other monsters' effects while in the Extra
    Monster Zone. If this card is Ritual Summoned: You can destroy as many Spells/Traps
    your opponent controls as possible, then if this card is in the Extra Monster
    Zone, you can banish all Spells/Traps from your opponent's GY. You can only use
    this effect of \"Archfiend Matriarch\" once per turn."
